cas Zahos Architects’ drawing update, revision P7 of 27 May 2026, studies curved buildings, vistas, tower separation and a landscaped plaza. All imagery is preliminary and should not be understood as approved built form.</p></div></div><div class="project-gallery"><figure><div class="image-wrap"><img alt="Lot 101 project source or reference image" loading="lazy" src="<?php echo esc_url( get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/images/lot101-port-road-view.jpg' ); ?>"/><span class="image-label">SOURCE CONCEPT / PENDING RIGHTS</span></div><figcaption>Lot101 Port Road View</figcaption></figure><figure><div class="image-wrap"><img alt="Lot 101 project source or reference image" loading="lazy" src="<?php echo esc_url( get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/images/lot101-hotel-view.jpg' ); ?>"/><span class="image-label">SOURCE CONCEPT / PENDING RIGHTS</span></div><figcaption>Lot101 Hotel View</figcaption></figure><figure><div class="image-wrap"><img alt="Lot 101 project source or reference image" loading="lazy" src="<?php echo esc_url( get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/images/lot101-apartment-view.jpg' ); ?>"/><span class="image-label">SOURCE CONCEPT / PENDING RIGHTS</span></div><figcaption>Lot101 Apartment View</figcaption></figure><figure><div class="image-wrap"><img alt="Lot 101 project source or reference image" loading="lazy" src="<?php echo esc_url( get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/images/lot101-plaza-plan.jpg' ); ?>"/><span class="image-label">SOURCE CONCEPT / PENDING RIGHTS</span></div><figcaption>Lot101 Plaza Plan</figcaption></figure><figure><div class="image-wrap"><img alt="Lot 101 project source or reference image" loading="lazy" src="<?php echo esc_url( get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/images/lot101-elevation.jpg' ); ?>"/><span class="image-label">SOURCE CONCEPT / PENDING RIGHTS</span></div><figcaption>Lot101 Elevation</figcaption></figure></div></div></section><section class="section color-section"><div class="container two-column"><div><span class="eyebrow">03 / THE EXPERIENCE</span><h2>Hospitality. Residences. Connection.</h2></div><p class="large-copy">The studies consider a hotel component, apartments, landscaped outdoor areas and street-level destinations. Final layout, yields and operator appointments remain under review.</p></div></section><section class="section"><div class="container two-column"><div><span class="eyebrow">04 / THE LOCATION</span><h2>Adelaide, Australia.</h2></div><div><p class="large-copy">The Port Road and Adam Street corridor connects inner Adelaide, Hindmarsh and nearby entertainment destinations.</p><a class="text-link" href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url('/lifestyle/' ) ); ?>#adelaide">Explore the local lifestyle ↗</a></div></div></section><section class="section"><div class="container two-column"><div><span class="eyebrow">BEYOND THE BUILDING</span><h2>Experience Adelaide.</h2><p class="large-copy">Explore the restaurants, major sporting events, galleries, neighbourhoods and cultural destinations that make this city memorable.</p><a class="button button-dark" href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url('/lifestyle/' ) ); ?>#adelaide">Explore Adelaide lifestyle →</a><p class="fine">Travel times and venue access depend on individual journeys. Lifestyle imagery is illustrative.</p></div><div class="image-wrap" style="height:480px"><img alt="Illustrative Adelaide lifestyle scene" loading="lazy" src="<?php echo esc_url( get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/images/adelaide-dining.webp' ); ?>"/><span class="image-label">ILLUSTRATIVE IMAGE</span></div></div></section><section class="project-close"><div class="container"><span class="eyebrow">PROJECT ENQUIRIES</span><h2>Discover more about Lot 101.</h2><a class="button button-light" href="contact.html?project=lot-101">Register your interest ↗</a><p class="fine light-fine">Preliminary masterplan. All specifications, imagery and appointments require approval before publication.</p></div></section></main>